{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: Agent基础概念MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"ReAct 框架的原理是什么？请详细描述 Thought-Action-Observation 循环\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent基础概念\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/基础概念\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">ReAct（Reasoning + Acting）框架是 Agent 领域最重要的设计模式之一。请详细解释其原理、核心循环流程，并用代码示例说明如何实现。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>ReAct 概述：</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">ReAct 来自论文《ReAct: Synergizing Reasoning and Acting in Language Models》（Yao et al., 2023），它将<strong>推理（Reasoning）</strong>与<strong>行动（Acting）</strong>交替进行，形成 Thought → Action → Observation 的循环，直到完成任务。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">核心思想：<strong>让 LLM 边思考边行动，每步都根据上一步的观察结果调整策略</strong>。</p>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>ReAct 循环的三个核心元素：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Thought（思考）</strong>：LLM 分析当前状态，描述观察结果并提出推理，决定下一步做什么</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Action（行动）</strong>：根据思考结果，选择一个工具并传入参数执行</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Observation（观察）</strong>：接收工具返回的结果，作为下一步思考的依据</li>\n</ol>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">ReAct 循环示意：\n\n用户提问：\"2024年诺贝尔文学奖得主是谁？他的代表作有哪些？\"\n\nStep 1:\n  Thought: 我需要查询2024年诺贝尔文学奖得主的信息\n  Action: search(query=\"2024年诺贝尔文学奖得主\")\n  Observation: \"2024年诺贝尔文学奖授予韩国作家韩江（Han Kang）\"\n\nStep 2:\n  Thought: 已获知获奖者是韩江，现在需要查询她的代表作\n  Action: search(query=\"韩江 代表作 作品\")\n  Observation: \"韩江代表作包括《素食者》《少年来了》《白》等\"\n\nStep 3:\n  Thought: 我已经获得了足够的信息来回答用户的问题\n  Action: finish(answer=\"2024年诺贝尔文学奖得主是韩国作家韩江...\")\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>ReAct 的数学表达：</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">设时间步 t 的状态为 <span class=\"math math-inline is-loaded\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45C TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math></mjx-container></span>，其中 <span class=\"math math-inline is-loaded\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math></mjx-container></span> 是 reasoning（thought），<span class=\"math math-inline is-loaded\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math></mjx-container></span> 是 action，<span class=\"math math-inline is-loaded\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45C TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math></mjx-container></span> 是 observation。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">上下文历史为：<br>\n<span class=\"math math-block is-loaded\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c210E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45C TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2026\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45C TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math></mjx-container></span></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">其中 <span class=\"math math-inline is-loaded\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math></mjx-container></span> 是用户输入。Agent 按照策略 <span class=\"math math-inline is-loaded\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math></mjx-container></span> 生成：<br>\n<span class=\"math math-block is-loaded\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2223\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"4\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c210E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2223\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"4\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c210E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2223\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"4\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c210E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math></mjx-container></span></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">即先产生 thought，再在 thought 指导下产生 action。</p>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>完整代码实现：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> typing <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Optional\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> dataclasses <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> dataclass\n\n<span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@dataclass</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Tool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    name<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>\n    description<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>\n    func<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">callable</span>\n\n<span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@dataclass</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ReActStep</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>\n    action<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>\n    observation<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ReActAgent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n    ReAct Agent 核心实现\n    Thought → Action → Observation 循环\n    \"\"\"</span>\n    \n    REACT_PROMPT_TEMPLATE <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"你是一个智能助手，可以通过工具来解决问题。\n    \n可用工具：\n{tool_descriptions}\n\n请按照以下格式思考和工作：\nThought: [你对当前情况的分析和推理]\nAction: [工具名称, 参数]\nObservation: [工具返回结果]\n\n历史步骤：\n{history}\n\n用户问题：{question}\n\n当前步骤的 Thought:\"\"\"</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> llm_client<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>Tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_steps<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm_client\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>t<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> t <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> t <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>max_steps <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> max_steps\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>history<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>ReActStep<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_format_tool_descriptions</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"格式化工具描述\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n            <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"- </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>description<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>items<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_format_history</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"格式化历史步骤\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>history<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"（无）\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n            <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"Step </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>i<span class=\"token operator\">+</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">:\\nThought: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>step<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\n\"</span></span>\n            <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"Action: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>step<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\nObservation: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>step<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>observation<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> i<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> step <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">enumerate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>history<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_parse_thought_and_action</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> llm_output<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">tuple</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"解析 LLM 输出的 Thought 和 Action\"\"\"</span>\n        lines <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm_output<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>strip<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>split<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'\\n'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        thought <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span>\n        action <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> line <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> lines<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> line<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>startswith<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Thought:\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                thought <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> line<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>replace<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Thought:\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>strip<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">elif</span> line<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>startswith<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Action:\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                action <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> line<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>replace<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Action:\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>strip<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> action\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_execute_action</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> action<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"执行工具调用\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 解析 action 格式: \"tool_name, param1=value1, param2=value2\"</span>\n        parts <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>p<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>strip<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> p <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> action<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>split<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\",\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        tool_name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> parts<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        params <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> p <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> parts<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"=\"</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> p<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                k<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> v <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> p<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>split<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"=\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                params<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>k<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>strip<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>strip<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> tool_name <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"错误：工具 '</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">' 不存在\"</span></span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>func<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">**</span>params<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> Exception <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"工具执行错误：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">run</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> question<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n        执行 ReAct 循环\n        \"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> step <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">range</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>max_steps<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 构建 prompt</span>\n            prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>REACT_PROMPT_TEMPLATE<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">format</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                tool_descriptions<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_format_tool_descriptions<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                history<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_format_history<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                question<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>question\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 调用 LLM 生成 Thought</span>\n            llm_output <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> action <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_parse_thought_and_action<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>llm_output<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 检查是否已完成</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"finish\"</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> action<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>lower<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">or</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"答案\"</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> action<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> thought  <span class=\"token comment\"># 返回答案</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 执行 Action</span>\n            observation <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_execute_action<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 记录历史</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>history<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>ReActStep<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                thought<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                action<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                observation<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>observation\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"Step </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>step <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">:\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"  Thought: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"  Action: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"  Observation: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>observation<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token format-spec\">200]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">...\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"达到最大步数限制\"</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># ===== 使用示例 =====</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">search</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"模拟搜索工具\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"搜索结果：关于 '</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">' 的相关信息...\"</span></span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">calculator</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>expression<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"模拟计算器工具\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token builtin\">eval</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>expression<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"计算错误\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 初始化 Agent</span>\nagent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ReActAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    llm_client<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>llm_client<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    tools<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n        Tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"search\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> description<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"搜索信息\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> func<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>search<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        Tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"calculator\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> description<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"计算表达式\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> func<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>calculator<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    max_steps<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">10</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 运行</span>\nresult <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>run<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"2024年诺贝尔奖得主是谁？\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>ReAct 相比纯 CoT（Chain-of-Thought）的优势：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>纯 CoT</th>\n<th>ReAct</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>外部信息</td>\n<td>无法获取</td>\n<td>通过工具动态获取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误修正</td>\n<td>推理错误会传播</td>\n<td>观察结果可纠正错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事实验证</td>\n<td>依赖训练数据</td>\n<td>可实时验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任务复杂度</td>\n<td>适合纯推理题</td>\n<td>适合需要外部信息的复杂任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可解释性</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>更好（思考+行动全过程可见）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：ReAct 中的 Thought 是必须显式输出的吗？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：不一定。可以显式输出（便于调试和可解释性），也可以隐式内化在 LLM 内部。显式输出更易于人类监督和干预。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：ReAct 的最大步数一般设多少？如何优化效率？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：通常 10-15 步。优化：①工具描述要精简 ②提供 few-shot 示例 ③设置合理超时 ④对常见任务做 plan 缓存</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：ReAct 是最先进的 Agent 架构，所有场景都应该用</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：ReAct 适合工具调用不确定、需要动态调整的场景。对于步骤固定的流程，Plan-and-Execute 更高效</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关\" dir=\"auto\">相关</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a> — 返回主题导航</li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}